---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 27, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Wire Local"
  description="How Wire Local collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-inner">
      <nav class="legal-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">wirelocal.app</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <header class="legal-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">
        <p>
          Wire Local ("we", "our", or "us") is a product of Tolowa Pacific LLC. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use the Wire Local mobile application and wirelocal.app website.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect the following categories of information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Location data.</strong> With your permission, we collect precise location to show nearby incidents and to tag community submissions. Location is used in-app only and is not sold to third parties.</li>
          <li><strong>Account information.</strong> If you create an account (via Apple Sign In or email), we store a user identifier, display name, and preferences.</li>
          <li><strong>User-submitted content.</strong> Photos, tip text, and category tags you submit through the app may be displayed publicly on Wire Local and the associated city website (e.g., spokanewire.com).</li>
          <li><strong>Usage data.</strong> Standard analytics including session duration, screen views, and crash reports. Collected via Sentry (error tracking).</li>
          <li><strong>Push notification preferences.</strong> Your per-category and radius settings for push alerts.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To deliver real-time incident alerts and feed content relevant to your location</li>
          <li>To display and moderate community-submitted tips and photos</li>
          <li>To calculate contributor points, leaderboard ranks, and badge awards</li>
          <li>To send push notifications based on your radius and category preferences</li>
          <li>To improve app performance and debug issues</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Service providers</strong> necessary to operate the app (cloud hosting, analytics, push notification delivery)</li>
          <li><strong>Law enforcement</strong> when required by law or to protect public safety</li>
        </ul>
        <p>User-submitted content (photos, tips) is public once published.</p>
        <p>Our website loads fonts from Google Fonts, a third party that receives your IP address when the page loads.</p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>Account data is retained until you delete your account. You can delete your account at any time in Settings → Account → Delete account. Submitted content may remain visible if referenced in published news or public safety records.</p>

        <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>Wire Local is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. Contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@wirelocal.app">privacy@wirelocal.app</a> to make a request.</p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of material changes via in-app notification or email.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions? Email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@wirelocal.app">privacy@wirelocal.app</a> or write to Tolowa Pacific LLC, Spokane, WA.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 80px var(--sw-s-4) 64px;
    min-height: 80svh;
  }

  .legal-inner {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--sw-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--sw-fs-11);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: var(--sw-track-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sw-ink-muted);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .legal-breadcrumb a { color: var(--sw-red); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sw-s-3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sw-border);
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--sw-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--sw-fs-11);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: var(--sw-track-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sw-ink-muted);
  }

  .legal-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--sw-font-sans);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
    letter-spacing: var(--sw-track-snug);
    color: var(--sw-ink);
  }

  .meta {
    font-size: var(--sw-fs-13);
    color: var(--sw-ink-faint);
  }

  .legal-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sw-s-6);
    font-size: var(--sw-fs-15);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--sw-ink-muted);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--sw-font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--sw-fs-18);
    color: var(--sw-ink);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sw-s-2);
  }

  .legal-body a { color: var(--sw-red); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .legal-body a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .legal-body strong { color: var(--sw-ink); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
